    "- only variables needed by this tutorial;\n",
    "- the same configured physics selections as the main analysis.\n",
    "\n",
    "The loader also constructs two important MC weight columns:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "weight_uncorrected : nominal MC weight before the DY correction\n",
    "weight             : nominal MC weight including the official DY correction\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "For Data both are 1."
   ]
  },
